    <string name="about_privacy_title">Privacy</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_body">Atoll uses Android Live Updates for the pill. The optional permission to draw over other apps is only for the calibration ruler. Atoll does not use accessibility, read other apps’ notifications, or access the internet. Android may include your settings in device backups.</string>
    <string name="about_credits_title">Trademarks</string>
    <string name="about_credits_body">iPhone and Dynamic Island are trademarks of Apple Inc. and are used only to name size references. ColorOS belongs to OPPO. Atoll is not affiliated with either company.</string>
